(93, 'non-verbal-intelligence', 'Non-Verbal Intelligence', 'Non-verbal question 33: A square sheet of paper is folded once in half down the middle (left half folded over the right half). A hole is punched in the folded paper as shown. Which figure shows the paper when it is unfolded?', 'NON_VERBAL', 'MEDIUM', 'A', 'B', 'C', 'D', 'B', 'Unfolding reflects the hole across the fold line (vertical centre line): one hole becomes two holes at the same height, one on each side of the fold.', '/images/full-mock-tests/first-full-mock-test/q093.png'),
