(104, 'non-verbal-intelligence', 'Non-Verbal Intelligence', 'Non-verbal question 44: The figure is a grid of 3 rows × 4 columns of equal small squares. How many rectangles of all sizes (including squares) are there in it?', 'NON_VERBAL', 'HARD', 'A', 'B', 'C', 'D', 'B', 'Choose 2 of 4 horizontal lines and 2 of 5 vertical lines: C(4,2) × C(5,2) = 6 × 10 = 60.', '/images/full-mock-tests/first-full-mock-test/q104.png'),
(105, 'non-verbal-intelligence', 'Non-Verbal Intelligence', 'Non-verbal question 45: Figure A is changed into Figure B by a rule. Apply the same rule to Figure C. (First figure : second figure :: third figure : ?)', 'NON_VERBAL', 'HARD', 'A', 'B', 'C', 'D', 'D', 'The first figure is rotated 90° anticlockwise to give the second. The same change applied to the third figure gives the answer.', '/images/full-mock-tests/first-full-mock-test/q105.png'),
